# Evaluation Results Directory

This directory contains evaluation results for AI tool benchmarks.

## Structure

```
evaluations/
├── <tool-name>/          # e.g., copilot/, cursor/, codeium/
│   ├── T1_scorecard.yaml      # Manual scoring for task T1
│   ├── T1_diff_report.md      # Human-readable diff analysis
│   ├── T1_metrics.json        # Automated metrics (LOC, complexity, etc.)
│   └── ...
└── comparison/
    ├── T1_tool_comparison.md   # Side-by-side comparison
    └── T1_comparison_metrics.json
```

## Workflow

1. AI tool implementations live in branches: `tool/<name>/task-<ID>`
2. Evaluation scripts generate artifacts in this directory
3. Evaluation results are committed and merged to main
4. Implementation branches are tagged and optionally deleted

See `benchmark/README.md` for complete workflow documentation.
